{"version":1,"content":"<p>特斯拉的支出再次低於華爾街預期，給埃隆·馬斯克將這家電動車製造商轉變為人工智能和機械人公司的計劃蒙上陰影。特斯拉周三在聲明中表示，第三季度資本支出總計47.3億美元。數據顯示，分析師平均預期為79.5億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583276.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.039025+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:25:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"364e93c782ca076c7d2732dacdeeefbe09073479144ffccc766405877eee3f58","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}